  )
Maintainer: Cassandra Stamsaas <cassandra.stamsaas@nmbu.no>
Description: Processing and analysis of amplicon sequencing data, with a
    primary focus on eDNA metabarcoding while remaining applicable to
    general targeted sequencing workflows. The package provides a
    user-friendly interface for core 'VSEARCH' (Rognes et al. (2016),
    <doi:10.7717/peerj.2584>) functions, extended with dedicated tools for
    visualization and parameter tuning.
License: GPL (>= 3)
